195
00:15:27,094 --> 00:15:28,754
yeah

196
00:15:28,754 --> 00:15:32,754
let's play again one day

197
00:15:32,754 --> 00:15:38,554
ashito good luck out there

198
00:15:38,554 --> 00:15:40,614
smile

199
00:15:40,614 --> 00:15:42,494
well this is it everybody

200
00:15:42,494 --> 00:15:44,194
smile

201
00:15:44,194 --> 00:15:46,354
i have to keep smiling

202
00:15:46,354 --> 00:15:48,694
