203
00:15:48,694 --> 00:15:50,374
all thanks to you guys

204
00:15:50,374 --> 00:15:53,194
so i'm gonna become the best player in the world

205
00:15:53,194 --> 00:15:55,734
don't worry shun

206
00:15:55,734 --> 00:15:57,974
