211
00:16:09,954 --> 00:16:17,814
it looks like a letter

212
00:16:17,814 --> 00:16:19,994
it's got something else in it too

213
00:16:19,994 --> 00:16:22,414
what's more

214
00:16:22,414 --> 00:16:30,134
this box has got some weight to it

215
00:16:30,134 --> 00:16:32,594
