234
00:17:19,274 --> 00:17:26,454
well i think i could handle something like that

235
00:17:26,454 --> 00:17:28,314
the only thing i'm worried about

236
00:17:28,314 --> 00:17:31,714
is that this letter is mom's way of saying she'll miss me

237
00:17:31,714 --> 00:17:33,294
or that she's sad i'm leaving

238
00:17:33,294 --> 00:17:38,094
oh whatever

239
00:17:38,094 --> 00:17:51,234
dear ashito

240
00:17:51,234 --> 00:17:52,634
first things first

241
00:17:52,634 --> 00:17:54,674
i'm sorry i didn't come to see you off

242
00:17:54,674 --> 00:17:56,154
also

243
00:17:56,154 --> 00:18:00,174
