244
00:18:00,174 --> 00:18:02,294
i'm sorry for brushing you off

245
00:18:02,294 --> 00:18:03,934
thing is

246
00:18:03,934 --> 00:18:06,694
being sad or gloomy just doesn't suit me

247
00:18:06,694 --> 00:18:08,554
and frankly i'm a little selfish

248
00:18:08,554 --> 00:18:09,534
i'm sorry

249
00:18:09,534 --> 00:18:10,214
again

250
00:18:10,214 --> 00:18:12,654
there's a bank book and a card in the envelope

251
00:18:12,654 --> 00:18:15,814
you can use the money for your day-to-day living expenses

252
00:18:15,814 --> 00:18:18,934
don't worry about your tuition and club fees

253
00:18:18,934 --> 00:18:20,114
i'll be taking care of those

254
00:18:20,114 --> 00:18:22,474
though i wasn't sure what else you might need

255
00:18:22,474 --> 00:18:24,394
once you got settled in at your new school

256
00:18:24,394 --> 00:18:27,394
i still have my bar to think about

257
00:18:27,394 --> 00:18:30,814
and if i kept this money i'd probably spend it on something stupid

258
00:18:30,814 --> 00:18:31,794
that's why

259
00:18:31,794 --> 00:18:34,334
i figured it'd be best to give it to you now

260
00:18:34,334 --> 00:18:35,954
you better not waste it

261
00:18:35,954 --> 00:18:38,494
mom

262
00:18:38,494 --> 00:18:41,634
i know i said this earlier

263
00:18:41,634 --> 00:18:45,614
but i'm sorry again for ignoring you whenever you wanted to talk to me

264
00:18:45,614 --> 00:18:48,754
to tell you the truth

265
00:18:48,754 --> 00:18:50,554
i didn't want to have that conversation

266
00:18:50,554 --> 00:18:53,634
because i already knew what you were going to tell me

267
00:18:53,634 --> 00:18:55,574
because that night

268
00:18:55,574 --> 00:18:58,174
the reason i play

269
00:18:58,174 --> 00:19:00,354
why i want this so bad

270
