is for her

271
00:19:01,294 --> 00:19:04,074
i heard what you said

272
00:19:04,074 --> 00:19:05,454
when you were on the phone

273
00:19:05,454 --> 00:19:20,894
that was enough for me

274
00:19:20,894 --> 00:19:22,854
thank you ashito

275
00:19:22,854 --> 00:19:24,614
but seriously

276
00:19:24,614 --> 00:19:26,834
i can't have you saying that kind of thing to my face

277
00:19:26,834 --> 00:19:28,134
you get it right

278
00:19:28,134 --> 00:19:32,554
wait no way

279
00:19:32,554 --> 00:19:33,494
you're kidding me

280
00:19:33,494 --> 00:19:34,874
mom what the heck

281
00:19:34,874 --> 00:19:36,934
why are you getting sappy all of a sudden

282
00:19:36,934 --> 00:19:38,534
this is too much

283
00:19:38,534 --> 00:19:41,294
i told myself that i'd leave with a smile on my face

284
00:19:41,294 --> 00:19:45,974
i'm sorry i couldn't afford to buy you new cleats before

285
00:19:45,974 --> 00:19:48,834
so as a farewell gift

286
00:19:48,834 --> 00:20:04,494
would you look at that your mom saved up enough to buy real gear

287
00:20:04,494 --> 00:20:19,594
remember how you used to be crazy poor

288
00:20:19,594 --> 00:20:24,874
the only thing i'm worried about is how short-tempered you can be

289
00:20:24,874 --> 00:20:29,534
but i know that it's proof that you've grown into an earnest and sincere person

290
00:20:29,534 --> 00:20:31,374
you take a lot after me

291
00:20:31,374 --> 00:20:34,474
if you're concerned about our finances

292
00:20:34,474 --> 00:20:35,494
don't be

293
00:20:35,494 --> 00:20:36,514
i'm your mother

294
00:20:36,514 --> 00:20:39,434
it's my job to support you in whatever you want to do

295
00:20:39,434 --> 00:20:40,774
plus with you gone

296
00:20:40,774 --> 00:20:42,294
there's one less mouth to feed

297
00:20:42,294 --> 00:20:45,354
don't forget there are others around you too

298
00:20:45,354 --> 00:20:47,254
people who are rooting for you

299
00:20:47,254 --> 00:20:49,414
and who lift you up when you need help

300
00:20:49,414 --> 00:20:52,614
you have lots of people who are in your corner

301
00:20:52,614 --> 00:20:55,034
and i'm sure you'll meet even more in tokyo

302
00:20:55,034 --> 00:20:56,614
be grateful for their support

303
00:20:56,614 --> 00:20:58,174
and don't get a big head

304
00:20:58,174 --> 00:21:00,354
one more thing

305
00:21:00,354 --> 00:21:02,734
i don't know too much about soccer

306
00:21:02,734 --> 00:21:05,834
so whether you're good at it or not

307
00:21:05,834 --> 00:21:07,654
or if you'll go pro or not

308
00:21:07,654 --> 00:21:09,454
none of that really matters to me

309
00:21:09,454 --> 00:21:10,174
honestly

310
00:21:10,174 --> 00:21:12,254
it wouldn't change the way i feel

311
00:21:12,254 --> 00:21:14,494
because whether you succeed or not

312
00:21:14,494 --> 00:21:17,634
i will always be so proud of you ashito

313
00:21:17,634 --> 00:21:30,234
i've been proud of you ever since you were born

314
00:21:30,234 --> 00:21:33,174
please don't ever forget that

315
00:21:33,174 --> 00:21:42,854
make sure you're eating well

316
00:21:42,854 --> 00:21:44,854
